<!--
    The sun looking out from behind a cloud: the look of the sky, which is what the name says.

    The cloud line is loose on purpose and leaves a gap along its base, and the rays are
    not quite even. The cloud is drawn last and filled white, so it covers the part of the
    sun behind it rather than the sun being cut to fit. Everything sits inside the central
    66 units, where no launcher mask reaches. Mean ink at 48px is 0.64.
-->
